   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "**Dials Studio \u2014 MiniMax H3**\n\nDials are ~14 KB steering files made from prompt pairs (no training). The **Apply Dial** strength is a slider: negative moves toward the pair's A side (still), positive toward B (moving).\n\n- **\u22122**: near-frozen, cinemagraph-like.\n- **+2**: everything zooms.\n\n- **Evil**: pick a flavour (sinister breaks speech audio; unhinged really is unhinged). 0 = off.\n\nDials stack with each other and with LoRAs: add more Load Dial \u2192 Apply Dial pairs in the chain. `h3_motion_lora.safetensors` is the same dial as a LoRA file (stock *Load LoRA (model only)*, use ~1.6\u00d7 strength)."
   ]
  }
